{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>台灣知名網紅艾瑞絲（Aries）平時常透過社群平台分享生活點滴。近日她上傳一段自彈自唱的影片至TikTok，沒想到焦點卻被網友們歪樓放在「激凸」話題上。對此，艾瑞絲10月9日毫不避諱地發文直球回應，大方公開自己多年不穿胸罩（內衣、胸圍）的生活習慣。</p><p>艾瑞絲在文中透露，影片是她每晚享受的「me time」時光，對於網友在留言區熱烈討論激凸，她笑說：</p><p>她坦言，自己穿胸罩時常感到壓迫、血液不順暢且悶熱，認為舒適度才是首要考量：「穿衣服沒必要讓自己不舒服。」</p><figure><img alt=\"艾瑞絲在影片中激凸被討論，大方回應已經不穿胸罩很多年了。（Instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185626432601067520596703.png/nrj9Kcm9aVL69Db_OOg_0TS6WzqQM57OFaGIORWhiDk\"/><figcaption>艾瑞絲在影片中激凸被討論，大方回應已經不穿胸罩很多年了。（Instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><p>更多艾瑞絲Aries的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185627028284510208634150.jpeg/rTrWbR0PTG8SMhLIM6V-yXvcMu6XlNDKFaiRUBWokVA\"/><figcaption>艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185627030612480000268903.jpeg/uxTezVuUgRI0IEh_ju9sGkDu5jIG9aRT0VYredFWK3k\"/><figcaption>艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185627032932061184524930.jpeg/gW45csNVVDUnd2vLSOv4-iz2ZrXpStGMIzWkVCM1pFQ\"/><figcaption>艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185627035109036032098751.jpeg/EIxwJxKpjUG__eLtHF8a1isVFh4TlmBYusFyZbrBcmU\"/><figcaption>艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185627037353119744536709.jpeg/wtH4-Jn93WbFq3ThTA2RRtnp9ho7mfRrKIx4ryiMeK8\"/><figcaption>艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185627026871029760195376.jpeg/TNISsnW47eNgV8-P_xflbJg-ANCWpnjLLwpRFi8KURY\"/><figcaption>艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185627029291274240107249.jpeg/Q8HfqMauZUZGyYy_QYLr7k2UG59vCPM8rYHzR62B80c\"/><figcaption>艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185627031531163648271693.jpeg/egNK-GpnhDYIEZPT7f70mRQSJTSVsDSFq1OwrqtTsK4\"/><figcaption>艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185627033657806848974835.jpeg/ImWYJQXmHupgjTqIeEgWz4xjRoNpnbC6PXMG6j1zBuo\"/><figcaption>艾瑞絲Aries（Instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221103/664821943992717312364159.png/Oq_SY9pi8-1D1WUuXWurmnT4fdOQycT0-n83ifp_N4k\"/><figcaption>Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221103/664821938904764416736085.png/-TgY1JO-hdbJnlDzYvkBEe7SFaanTidx2bCELdmwhC0\"/><figcaption>Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221103/664821941215956992196328.png/J3gDwOMQ9GxdxQQsqdZQfrqT_S6a686UOUXmVDlF5lQ\"/><figcaption>Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221103/664821933695176704893462.png/yGJl2J8a5BCa6W9kISKKItsPgRJgpbDs9m9kcvZvZHI\"/><figcaption>Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221103/664821936492908544182953.png/d2X-wReYxK70MncR52chD_xIn39-CqLsayP3qmsj96o\"/><figcaption>Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221103/664821931094577152648795.png/a_Tm1p8_nAaywluXSbPJ2ql-f-i6c6nRjCkXqIwpF6g\"/><figcaption>Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221103/664821925813686272843209.png/9pq0crIPDZLUHJ57OGiSmd6pMT0DbBouwcedU8HHnVM\"/><figcaption>Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221103/664821928443645952308176.png/Kb70hGWqrM9qAEc4p_GGgP_-VnGs13wwVnvmi1Z75os\"/><figcaption>Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221103/664821923255029760459087.png/6CG9N_3HLNy04cmabFr8lVZrRYCOWM7oJdDojSXQ6I0\"/><figcaption>Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221103/664821920599904256398651.png/IJfA3szmlE9kPMe1CDa4qsFno9ddxeOB7KxtB-ysbQc\"/><figcaption>Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221101/664097613510873088852431.png/FPov2iv8zh2aSe5LCE0M-9x0P2Mifx9ikk_is5JP4rM\"/><figcaption>Aries艾瑞絲（instagram@aries_8248）</figcaption></figure><p>針對外界的傳統眼光，艾瑞絲直言華人圈相較於國外傳統許多，常將不穿胸罩貼上不檢點或羞恥的標籤。她霸氣反問：</p><p>她分享過去在國外生活的經驗，指出國外風氣對此相當隨意，根本不會有人特別注意。</p><p>艾瑞絲強調，自己並非刻意要提倡或宣導什麼，也沒有時間與酸民爭辯，單純「只是想要生活得chill一點」。她在文末寫下金句總結：</p><p>展現出自信做自己的率性態度，也立刻在網路上掀起一波關於身體自主權的熱烈討論。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：韓國百萬網紅洪瑛琦因「穿衣風格大膽」惹怒老公　自爆曾被撕爛衫】洪瑛琦靠嬌小外型與鮮明時尚風格累積百萬粉絲。（IG@kisy0729）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4196334/org/19dbbe9d74c0a54dcc178256adca601c.jpg/GmTsM6xSk6IXEl9achQYeizyQezy5qJfxcE5p8XBOac\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：韓國百萬網紅洪瑛琦因「穿衣風格大膽」惹怒老公　自爆曾被撕爛衫】洪瑛琦靠嬌小外型與鮮明時尚風格累積百萬粉絲。（IG@kisy0729）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173699667343577088486270.jpeg/Jp3jXrtjbFQyzu5xFaJipSITjcpVYTBk45YMeOOWDHg\"/><figcaption>洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173699687191023616986473.jpeg/wkn8h1LCFLtYFrh6Eh1f7zY6MP76ray651Xc7edV3O0\"/><figcaption>洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173699694593970176067523.jpeg/WQPOGhQ75h5o4Qi9jGbYN7ZrwtCpkmSfet0JBnrdCQY\"/><figcaption>洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173699696892579840764093.jpeg/_3NBOcz7f2rrGGEYoalhq_RtdDlKdRCt72yLNe9sizU\"/><figcaption>洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173699692324720640912356.jpeg/mpG-tHxgbLADCcsN0JHdYexGUp9Vr3-E8GFYlfBhWJU\"/><figcaption>洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173699700877299712042513.jpeg/hPOws3zRqqmW1m5oKlBJf55vGwhXf6McP8GLaD_Bi2g\"/><figcaption>洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173699693763366912351792.jpeg/IhTQxDbyjAvQMEBhrvU87wS1w2QmLTriDvqGaA76hmg\"/><figcaption>洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173699696296857600281460.jpeg/YdPfq7H5mSrJOenJMpuwfa1q39kqmMumgRZK1IEWStQ\"/><figcaption>洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"洪瑛琦（IG@kisy0729）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260907/1173699698616438784491875.jpeg/7k